## Reuse unchanged Mapping Designer previews

Context: Switching between already-mapped entities always reran the preview
query and displayed a loading spinner, even when the entity SQL and preview
limit had not changed. Mapping Designer now keeps successful entity previews
in memory and restores them immediately on subsequent selections.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/mapping/js/mapping-design.js
   Cache successful entity previews by entity URI, SQL, and row limit, then
   reuse unchanged results instead of repeating the preview API request.
